PROJECT WORKFLOW
================

##Preprocessing##
The ERA5 data sets are dowloaed as zip data, the following codes could be used to download, extract and 
process the data for for model training and operational forecasting.
download_era5_sardegna_complete.py
EXTRACTION.py
ERA_Daily_GRID.py
#####################################################
anim_mean_wind_direction.py and windrose_animation_Sardinia.py
These scripts generate animations showing the evolution of wind speed
and direction over Sardinia, providing a visual analysis of temporal
wind patterns.
################################################
01_train_fire_model_v5.py
Trains the LightGBM wildfire risk model using historical meteorological data.
The script performs data preprocessing, feature selection, model training,
and saves the trained model for subsequent forecasting.

02_Forecast_Fire_14D.py
Loads the trained model and generates wildfire risk forecasts for the next
14 days using meteorological forecast data.

04_validation_report.py
Evaluates the model performance by producing validation metrics, including
the confusion matrix, ROC AUC, PR AUC, precision, recall, and the
classification report.

05_AI_Forecast_Analysis.py
Generates graphical analyses of the model outputs, including probability
distributions, correlation analysis, and risk visualizations to support
interpretation of the predictions.

